 258:../../Middlewares/stedgeai-lib/Inc/ai_datatypes_internal.h ****  * @brief Check whether 2 shapes have identical dimensions.
 259:../../Middlewares/stedgeai-lib/Inc/ai_datatypes_internal.h ****  * @ingroup datatypes_internal
 260:../../Middlewares/stedgeai-lib/Inc/ai_datatypes_internal.h ****  * @param shape0 the 1st tensor shape to compare
 261:../../Middlewares/stedgeai-lib/Inc/ai_datatypes_internal.h ****  * @param shape1 the 2nd tensor shape to compare
